            },
            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "John Hennessy, Chair of the Board of Directors of Alphabet, through the John L. Hennessy & Andrea J. Hennessy Revocable Trust adopted a trading plan on November 5, 2024 (with the first trade under the plan scheduled for March 13, 2025). The trading plan will be effective until March 13, 2026 to sell 6,000 shares of Class C Capital Stock and 1,200 shares of Class A Common Stock.",
            "entity_name": "John Hennessy 10b5-1 Plan Adoption 2024-11-05",
            "entity_type_entity": "InsiderTransaction",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_9B"
            },
            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "Sundar Pichai, Chief Executive Officer, together with the Pichai Family Foundation, adopted a trading plan on December 2, 2024 (with the first trade under the plan scheduled for April 2, 2025). The trading plan will be effective until April 18, 2026 to sell an aggregate of 876,000 shares of Class C Capital Stock.",
            "entity_name": "Sundar Pichai 10b5-1 Plan Adoption 2024-12-02",
            "entity_type_entity": "InsiderTransaction",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_9B"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "On April 16, 2024, the Leadership Development, Inclusion and Compensation Committee of the Board of Directors of Alphabet approved the accrual of dividend equivalent units to current and future holders of all unvested stock units in connection with any regular cash dividend that may be declared by the Board of Directors of Alphabet from time to time.",
            "entity_name": "Alphabet Dividend Equivalent Units Policy Approval",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          }
